	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-AttackMove-Tooltip": "Attack Move",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-AttackMove-Desc": "Selected units will move to the desired location\nand attack any enemies they encounter en route.\n\nHold <(Ctrl)> while targeting to order an Assault Move\nthat attacks any units or structures encountered en route.\n\nLeft-click icon then right-click on target location.",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-ForceMove-Tooltip": "Force Move",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-ForceMove-Desc": "Selected units will move to the desired location\n - Default activity for the target is suppressed\n - Vehicles will attempt to crush enemies at the target location\n - Helicopters will land at the target location\n - Chrono Tanks will teleport towards the target location\n\nLeft-click icon then right-click on target.\nHold <(Alt)> to activate temporarily while commanding units.",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-ForceAttack-Tooltip": "Force Attack",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-ForceAttack-Desc": "Selected units will attack the targeted unit or location\n - Default activity for the target is suppressed\n - Allows targeting of own or ally forces\n - Long-range artillery units will always target the\n   location, ignoring units and buildings\n\nLeft-click icon then right-click on target.\nHold <(Ctrl)> to activate temporarily while commanding units.",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-Guard-Tooltip": "Guard",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-Guard-Desc": "Selected units will follow the targeted unit.\n\nLeft-click icon then right-click on target unit.",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-Deploy-Tooltip": "Deploy",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-Deploy-Desc": "Selected units will perform their default deploy activity\n - MCVs will unpack into a Construction Yard\n - Construction Yards will re-pack into a MCV\n - Transports will unload their passengers\n - Demolition Trucks and MAD Tanks will self-destruct\n - Minelayers will deploy a mine\n - Aircraft will return to base\n\nActs immediately on selected units.",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-Scatter-Tooltip": "Scatter",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-Scatter-Desc": "Selected units will stop their current activity\nand move to a nearby location.\n\nActs immediately on selected units.",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-Stop-Tooltip": "Stop",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-Stop-Desc": "Selected units will stop their current activity.\nSelected buildings will reset their rally point.\n\nActs immediately on selected targets.",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-QueueOrders-Tooltip": "Waypoint Mode",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-CommandBar-QueueOrders-Desc": "Use Waypoint Mode to give multiple linking commands\nto the selected units. Units will execute the commands\nimmediately upon receiving them.\n\nLeft-click icon then give commands in the game world.\nHold <(Shift)> to activate temporarily while commanding units.",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-StanceBar-AttackAnything-Tooltip": "Attack Anything Stance",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-StanceBar-AttackAnything-Desc": "Set the selected units to Attack Anything stance:\n - Units will attack enemy units and structures on sight\n - Units will pursue attackers across the battlefield",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-StanceBar-Defend-Tooltip": "Defend Stance",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-StanceBar-Defend-Desc": "Set the selected units to Defend stance:\n - Units will attack enemy units on sight\n - Units will not move or pursue enemies",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-StanceBar-ReturnFire-Tooltip": "Return Fire Stance",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-StanceBar-ReturnFire-Desc": "Set the selected units to Return Fire stance:\n - Units will retaliate against enemies that attack them\n - Units will not move or pursue enemies",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-StanceBar-HoldFire-Tooltip": "Hold Fire Stance",
	"Chrome-InGamePlayer-StanceBar-HoldFire-Desc": "Set the selected units to Hold Fire stance:\n - Units will not fire upon enemies\n - Units will not move or pursue enemies",

